    "body": "@LorenzMeier @vooon I tried some further test.\n\n## mavros without arming the system\n- Use `roslaunch mavros px4.launch`\n  ![snapshot31](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/2463397/12539983/ce883ce2-c339-11e5-8151-f4d3c597ce8f.png)\n- Then run `rostopic list`\n  ![snapshot32](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/2463397/12539984/cf277ee2-c339-11e5-9624-402a5e5766f2.png)\n- It seems that there was no `mavros/local_position/local` publishing.\n\n## mavros with arming the system\n- Arm the system by RC\n  ![snapshot33](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/2463397/12539993/13c602d0-c33a-11e5-893d-a6526fe4752a.png)\n- Then run `rostopic list`, still no `/mavros/local_position/local`. But other nodes receive data smoothly, such as `/mavros/local_position/pose`, by running \n\n```\nrostopic ehco /mavros/local_position/pose\n```\n\n![snapshot34](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/2463397/12539998/3055979e-c33a-11e5-83b5-29eb6f1feb6a.png)\n",
